1
00:00:09,277 --> 00:00:11,927
=The Glory Fades 2=

2
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:13,798
=Episode 9=

3
00:00:30,737 --> 00:00:31,737
Run.

4
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:33,030
Run.

5
00:00:33,078 --> 00:00:34,078
Let's go.

6
00:00:35,183 --> 00:00:36,782
Are you alright?

7
00:00:39,902 --> 00:00:40,902
Move!

8
00:00:42,023 --> 00:00:43,023
Hold him down!

9
00:00:43,742 --> 00:00:44,742
Lion!

10
00:00:45,822 --> 00:00:47,542
Mr. Tu, are you alright?

11
00:00:48,023 --> 00:00:49,023
You're bleeding so much.

12
00:01:03,303 --> 00:01:04,303
Lion.

13
00:01:04,583 --> 00:01:06,023
Phachai took his men after Mr. Tu.

14
00:01:06,462 --> 00:01:07,462
Don't worry.

15
00:01:08,303 --> 00:01:09,583
They're no match for him.

16
00:01:09,862 --> 00:01:11,142
There are two new guys.

17
00:01:11,222 --> 00:01:12,422
They look like trouble.

18
00:01:17,103 --> 00:01:19,502
Stop. It's not yard time yet. Go back.

19
00:01:19,502 --> 00:01:20,502
Step aside.

20
00:01:20,703 --> 00:01:21,823
I said, "Go back."

21
00:01:21,823 --> 00:01:22,823
You hear me?

22
00:01:24,502 --> 00:01:25,502
Let go!

23
00:01:32,422 --> 00:01:33,422
Tu Jiasheng.

24
00:01:33,582 --> 00:01:34,582
I'm sorry.

25
00:01:34,743 --> 00:01:35,743
I crossed the line.

26
00:01:48,222 --> 00:01:50,422
Mr. Tu, you can have
my tobacco and booze business.

27
00:01:50,703 --> 00:01:51,942
Please, spare me.

28
00:01:53,103 --> 00:01:55,183
Tu Jiasheng, if you kill me,

29
00:01:55,502 --> 00:01:57,063
you'll never get out of here alive.

30
00:01:59,022 --> 00:02:00,022
Mr. Tu.

31
00:02:00,782 --> 00:02:01,782
Be a better man

32
00:02:02,382 --> 00:02:03,623
in the afterlife.

33
00:02:09,103 --> 00:02:10,103
Boss!

34
00:02:28,023 --> 00:02:29,702
Warden, if there's nothing else,

35
00:02:29,702 --> 00:02:30,702
I'll take my leave.

36
00:02:31,942 --> 00:02:32,942
Captain Xia.

37
00:02:34,423 --> 00:02:36,662
I never forbade you from visiting him.

38
00:02:37,782 --> 00:02:39,542
But if Tu Jiasheng makes you

39
00:02:39,542 --> 00:02:40,822
forget your place,

40
00:02:42,183 --> 00:02:44,023
then I'll have to reconsider the matter.

41
00:02:44,183 --> 00:02:46,063
I just enjoy talking to Old Ghost,
that's all.

42
00:02:46,382 --> 00:02:48,063
I only visit him once in a while.

43
00:02:48,542 --> 00:02:49,542
Bad news!

44
00:02:50,303 --> 00:02:52,262
- Someone's dead.
- Calm down. Make it clear.

45
00:02:52,502 --> 00:02:53,502
Who's dead?

46
00:02:53,583 --> 00:02:54,583
Tu Jiasheng...

47
00:02:59,063 --> 00:03:00,343
Tu Jiasheng killed Phachai.

48
00:03:20,743 --> 00:03:21,743
Warden.

49
00:03:22,863 --> 00:03:23,863
Captain Xia.

50
00:03:24,542 --> 00:03:25,542
Warden.

51
00:03:26,023 --> 00:03:27,942
Two hitmen snuck in here

52
00:03:27,942 --> 00:03:29,382
to assassinate Phachai.

53
00:03:29,782 --> 00:03:31,262
I stepped in to help

54
00:03:32,423 --> 00:03:33,782
but couldn't stop them in time.

55
00:03:33,982 --> 00:03:35,702
And they came after me.

56
00:03:37,702 --> 00:03:38,982
I only acted in self-defense.

57
00:03:39,143 --> 00:03:40,143
He's lying.

58
00:03:40,982 --> 00:03:42,863
Tu Jiasheng killed the boss, didn't he?

59
00:03:42,863 --> 00:03:43,982
- I didn't see anything.
- Say it.

60
00:03:43,982 --> 00:03:45,502
- I didn't see anything.
- I can testify.

61
00:03:45,502 --> 00:03:47,222
Yeah, Lion here can testify.

62
00:03:47,343 --> 00:03:49,183
- He saw it.
- Phachai

63
00:03:49,222 --> 00:03:51,222
was indeed killed by those two hitmen.

64
00:03:51,863 --> 00:03:52,863
Tu Jiasheng

65
00:03:53,303 --> 00:03:54,303
was trying to save him.

66
00:03:54,303 --> 00:03:55,303
You...

67
00:03:59,343 --> 00:04:00,343
I saw it too.

68
00:04:00,942 --> 00:04:02,463
The hitmen tried to kill Phachai.

69
00:04:02,662 --> 00:04:04,143
Tu Jiasheng tried to save him.

70
00:04:04,542 --> 00:04:06,623
Then they went after Tu Jiasheng,

71
00:04:06,822 --> 00:04:08,303
but he took them down instead.

72
00:04:08,303 --> 00:04:09,303
That's what happened.

73
00:04:09,903 --> 00:04:11,743
Do you all take me for a fool?

74
00:04:11,822 --> 00:04:12,822
Warden.

75
00:04:14,463 --> 00:04:17,262
This is the high-security prison,
Sea Breeze.

76
00:04:17,942 --> 00:04:19,423
Two hitmen walked right in,

77
00:04:19,423 --> 00:04:21,222
carrying knives.

78
00:04:22,903 --> 00:04:24,423
If word got out,

79
00:04:26,423 --> 00:04:27,543
it would be a scandal.

80
00:04:30,575 --> 00:04:31,575
Jia Long.

81
00:04:31,822 --> 00:04:32,983
Take the bodies away.

82
00:04:33,303 --> 00:04:34,902
Due to a personal grudge,

83
00:04:35,582 --> 00:04:37,262
Phachai was attacked and murdered

84
00:04:37,543 --> 00:04:38,543
in an act of revenge

85
00:04:40,223 --> 00:04:41,223
by two new inmates.

86
00:04:44,902 --> 00:04:45,983
Put it on record

87
00:04:46,783 --> 00:04:47,783
that Tu Jiasheng

88
00:04:48,902 --> 00:04:49,902
tried to save Phachai.

89
00:04:50,702 --> 00:04:51,702
Yes, Sir.

90
00:04:52,743 --> 00:04:53,743
Come here.

91
00:05:01,223 --> 00:05:02,902
Take him to get his wounds treated.

92
00:05:04,223 --> 00:05:05,223
Once you're done,

93
00:05:06,462 --> 00:05:07,543
bring him to my office.

94
00:05:07,863 --> 00:05:08,863
Yes, Sir.

95
00:06:27,663 --> 00:06:29,983
Mr. Tu, can I ask you something?

96
00:06:30,423 --> 00:06:31,423
Go ahead.

97
00:06:31,582 --> 00:06:32,582
As you know,

98
00:06:32,783 --> 00:06:33,983
the Nie family runs this place.

99
00:06:34,063 --> 00:06:35,342
Taking over the tobacco and booze trade

100
00:06:35,342 --> 00:06:37,543
is like snatching food
straight from their bowl.

101
00:06:37,822 --> 00:06:39,303
Nie Feng won't just let it slide.

102
00:06:39,502 --> 00:06:40,582
How should I handle this?

103
00:06:40,702 --> 00:06:42,303
You've been in office for decades.

104
00:06:42,462 --> 00:06:43,462
You know what to do.

105
00:06:45,623 --> 00:06:46,623
Fine.

106
00:06:47,863 --> 00:06:49,262
I'd like to hear your thoughts.

107
00:06:53,462 --> 00:06:54,462
It's simple.

108
00:06:54,902 --> 00:06:56,663
I won't touch the trade directly.

109
00:06:57,183 --> 00:06:58,223
Lion will step up

110
00:06:58,423 --> 00:06:59,423
and take over.

111
00:06:59,623 --> 00:07:00,623
The Nie family

112
00:07:00,743 --> 00:07:01,743
won't be able

113
00:07:02,342 --> 00:07:03,382
to complain, right?

114
00:07:03,942 --> 00:07:05,423
You're willing to share the profit?

115
00:07:06,142 --> 00:07:07,783
The tobacco and booze trade

116
00:07:07,783 --> 00:07:09,502
is the biggest goldmine in Sea Breeze.

117
00:07:09,983 --> 00:07:11,382
Share the wealth,

118
00:07:11,582 --> 00:07:13,382
and the business lasts.

119
00:07:14,663 --> 00:07:16,423
Besides, Warden,

120
00:07:17,183 --> 00:07:18,342
in the Tianbei Duchy,

121
00:07:19,142 --> 00:07:20,863
the Nies aren't the only power.

122
00:07:22,262 --> 00:07:23,743
Not everyone wants me dead.

123
00:07:26,183 --> 00:07:27,783
The Grand Princess

124
00:07:28,063 --> 00:07:29,183
wants him alive for now.

125
00:07:33,063 --> 00:07:34,063
Fair enough.

126
00:07:35,582 --> 00:07:36,582
To our partnership.

127
00:07:37,942 --> 00:07:38,942
I have one condition.

128
00:07:42,303 --> 00:07:44,183
- Name it.
- There's a villa

129
00:07:44,902 --> 00:07:45,942
here in Sea Breeze.

130
00:07:46,142 --> 00:07:47,142
I want to move in.

131
00:07:52,022 --> 00:07:53,382
I never thought

132
00:07:53,822 --> 00:07:55,423
that I'd get to live in a villa.

133
00:07:55,663 --> 00:07:58,142
This is all thanks to you, Mr. Tu.

134
00:07:58,342 --> 00:08:00,142
Thank you, Mr. Tu.

135
00:08:02,863 --> 00:08:04,342
Since you want the villa,

136
00:08:05,262 --> 00:08:07,262
I happen to have another deal for you.

137
00:08:08,863 --> 00:08:10,022
You must have heard

138
00:08:10,103 --> 00:08:11,543
that the villa is meant

139
00:08:11,543 --> 00:08:13,423
to entertain
wealthy and powerful inmates.

140
00:08:16,543 --> 00:08:18,142
Those girls Phachai brought in before

141
00:08:18,142 --> 00:08:19,502
were terrible.

142
00:08:20,142 --> 00:08:21,863
I run Prosperity.

143
00:08:21,863 --> 00:08:23,063
That's my line of work.

144
00:08:23,103 --> 00:08:24,262
I'm looking to take over.

145
00:08:28,303 --> 00:08:30,623
As long as you take over this business,

146
00:08:30,623 --> 00:08:31,783
you can move around this place

147
00:08:32,223 --> 00:08:33,223
however you please.

148
00:08:33,303 --> 00:08:34,303
Alright.

149
00:08:34,783 --> 00:08:35,783
But I have to

150
00:08:36,502 --> 00:08:37,502
set the rules.

151
00:08:37,623 --> 00:08:39,022
As long as I get paid.

152
00:08:47,383 --> 00:08:48,383
Captain Xia.

153
00:08:48,543 --> 00:08:50,383
What's wrong? In a bad mood?

154
00:08:52,543 --> 00:08:53,663
I'll let you two talk.

155
00:08:53,663 --> 00:08:54,783
I'll tidy up the place.

156
00:08:57,303 --> 00:08:58,303
Tu Jiasheng,

157
00:08:58,503 --> 00:09:00,303
taking over the contraband trade
was one thing,

158
00:09:00,342 --> 00:09:02,183
but now you want the villa business too?

159
00:09:04,423 --> 00:09:05,423
It's just business.

160
00:09:05,982 --> 00:09:07,702
Pimping for Tang Zhen is business?

161
00:09:08,102 --> 00:09:09,822
How are you any different from Phachai?

162
00:09:10,063 --> 00:09:11,263
The Prosperity I know

163
00:09:11,342 --> 00:09:13,183
isn't what you claimed it was.

164
00:09:13,342 --> 00:09:14,822
Working voluntarily? Free to leave?

165
00:09:14,822 --> 00:09:16,622
Never forcing anyone? It was all a lie.

166
00:09:16,982 --> 00:09:17,982
Get out.

167
00:09:18,063 --> 00:09:19,063
Everyone, get out.

168
00:09:20,183 --> 00:09:21,183
Let me go.

169
00:09:21,622 --> 00:09:22,622
I'm not going in there.

170
00:09:23,263 --> 00:09:24,543
You frauds.

171
00:09:24,903 --> 00:09:26,862
- It's not up to you.
- Stop right there.

172
00:09:29,942 --> 00:09:30,942
Who are you?

173
00:09:32,342 --> 00:09:33,342
Police.

174
00:09:33,462 --> 00:09:34,462
Let them go.

175
00:09:36,023 --> 00:09:37,023
Officer,

176
00:09:37,303 --> 00:09:38,543
you came to the wrong place.

177
00:09:38,982 --> 00:09:40,622
I said, let them go.

178
00:09:41,143 --> 00:09:42,143
Hold on.

179
00:09:45,102 --> 00:09:46,423
Which precinct are you with?

180
00:09:46,982 --> 00:09:48,222
I've never seen you before.

181
00:09:48,742 --> 00:09:49,742
Sea Breeze Prison.

182
00:09:50,663 --> 00:09:51,663
Xia Yuyan.

183
00:09:52,903 --> 00:09:54,063
Sea Breeze Prison?

184
00:09:56,582 --> 00:09:57,742
A prison guard.

185
00:09:58,503 --> 00:10:00,582
No wonder
you're sticking your nose in this.

186
00:10:00,942 --> 00:10:02,222
Why don't you do your job?

187
00:10:02,742 --> 00:10:04,622
Of course I will.

188
00:10:05,063 --> 00:10:06,263
Take them all inside.

189
00:10:06,342 --> 00:10:07,862
I will investigate thoroughly

190
00:10:07,982 --> 00:10:09,143
and talk to all of them.

191
00:10:09,462 --> 00:10:10,462
Yes, Sir.

192
00:10:10,503 --> 00:10:11,503
Move it.

193
00:10:15,903 --> 00:10:16,903
Officer Xia.

194
00:10:17,383 --> 00:10:18,503
Here's my advice.

195
00:10:19,102 --> 00:10:20,183
Don't stick your nose

196
00:10:20,543 --> 00:10:21,702
into everything.

197
00:10:21,783 --> 00:10:23,383
You'll only get hurt.

198
00:10:27,263 --> 00:10:29,063
I can guess what it's like.

199
00:10:29,342 --> 00:10:30,702
Is it something new

200
00:10:30,862 --> 00:10:32,222
or was it always like that?

201
00:10:32,862 --> 00:10:33,862
Hurry up.

202
00:10:34,063 --> 00:10:35,063
Line up.

203
00:10:36,543 --> 00:10:37,543
Mr. Tu,

204
00:10:38,143 --> 00:10:39,263
they're all yours.

205
00:10:44,702 --> 00:10:46,263
They're human beings, not cattle.

206
00:10:46,622 --> 00:10:47,822
Don't you chain them up!

207
00:10:48,303 --> 00:10:49,423
Take those chains off.

208
00:10:50,742 --> 00:10:51,742
Captain Xia,

209
00:10:52,023 --> 00:10:53,383
the Warden ordered this.

210
00:10:53,783 --> 00:10:54,862
Take it up with him.

211
00:10:57,183 --> 00:10:58,742
Unlock them and let them go.

212
00:10:59,222 --> 00:11:00,222
No way.

213
00:11:00,663 --> 00:11:02,543
Tu Jiasheng, the Warden said...

214
00:11:02,543 --> 00:11:03,582
The Warden said

215
00:11:03,783 --> 00:11:04,783
everything

216
00:11:05,063 --> 00:11:06,423
is up to Tu Jiasheng here.

217
00:11:28,503 --> 00:11:30,423
- Shui.
- Mr. Tu.

218
00:11:30,663 --> 00:11:32,023
Take them to get changed.

219
00:11:32,383 --> 00:11:34,582
Captain Xia will get a car
to send them back.

220
00:11:34,582 --> 00:11:36,063
Got it. Come with me.

221
00:11:36,063 --> 00:11:37,063
Go on.

222
00:11:45,702 --> 00:11:46,702
I'm sorry

223
00:11:47,982 --> 00:11:48,982
about earlier.

224
00:11:53,742 --> 00:11:54,742
Where are you going?

225
00:11:54,942 --> 00:11:55,942
Just taking a stroll.

226
00:11:55,942 --> 00:11:59,503
Tang Zhen said I'm free
to walk around the villa area.

227
00:12:08,543 --> 00:12:10,503
Hello, Sir.

228
00:12:10,503 --> 00:12:11,982
I just moved in next door.

229
00:12:12,303 --> 00:12:13,423
We're neighbors now.

230
00:12:21,143 --> 00:12:22,702
Your vegetables look great,

231
00:12:23,263 --> 00:12:24,822
just a bit overgrown with weeds.

232
00:12:25,143 --> 00:12:26,222
Let me help you clear them.

233
00:12:57,590 --> 00:13:01,206
♪Streetlights stretch shadows long♪

234
00:13:01,576 --> 00:13:05,561
♪As crowds fade,
who lingers on the edge♪

235
00:13:10,317 --> 00:13:13,636
♪Guarding all those unfinished lies♪

236
00:13:13,636 --> 00:13:18,721
♪Wind sweeps through the empty harbor♪

237
00:13:22,310 --> 00:13:28,862
♪Time quietly strips away the madness♪

238
00:13:28,862 --> 00:13:37,283
♪Plunging all passion
into freezing cold♪

239
00:13:37,283 --> 00:13:40,512
♪The feast ends, leaving only emptiness♪

240
00:13:40,512 --> 00:13:43,707
♪The past drifts far away, unstoppable♪

241
00:13:43,707 --> 00:13:46,400
♪If regret is an inescapable wandering♪

242
00:13:46,400 --> 00:13:51,017
♪I swallow the silence, burning alone♪

243
00:13:54,928 --> 00:13:57,417
♪Burning alone♪

244
00:14:02,923 --> 00:14:09,292
♪The glory fades♪
